BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 8em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012-2학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅) 강의평가 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">추가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 시행과 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">관련된 사항을 안내하오니 아래의 내용을 참고하여 강의평가가 원활히 진행될 수 있도록 참여하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 강의평가의 목적</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;학생에게 한 학기 동안 받은 교육에 대한 평가를 스스로 함으로써 강의에 대한 자신의 의견과 요구사항을 학교에 표현할 수 있는 기회를 제공하고, 강의의 주체인 교수에게는 자신의 강의에 대한 피드백 기회를 제공함으로써 교육의 품질을 향상하고자 한다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 대상강좌&nbsp; : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012-2학기에 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)에 개설된 모든 강좌</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(단, 석ㆍ박사 논문연구지도 과목은 제외함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 설문대상&nbsp; :&nbsp; 2012-2학기 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)의 강좌별 수강학생 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 실시기간&nbsp; :&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 12. 3(월) ~ 12. 9(금) 23:59까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 평가형태&nbsp; :&nbsp; 원스톱서비스를 통한 설문평가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 평가방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">원스톱서비스 → 학사관리 → 강의평가&nbsp;→ 강의평가서작성</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">7. 강의평가 내용의 익명성은 보장됩니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 12.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반, 산업, 교육 및 컨설팅)장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
